WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
- Have you blown any money
on an indulgence of any sort?

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.936
- Ooh, well you know, a
lot in my life has changed.

00:00:05.936 --> 00:00:08.559
Except for the fact that I'm very cheap,

00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:09.392
(laughing)

00:00:09.392 --> 00:00:11.290
and that will be consistent.

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.150
But there is one thing I splurge on,

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.800
I feel like it's very relatable though.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.160
The one thing I will splurge on is

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.501
birthday parties for my dog.

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:20.740
(laughing)

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:21.948
I will spend

00:00:21.948 --> 00:00:24.500
- Does everyone relate?
- any amount of money

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.620
on my dog.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.293
She knows what I'm talking
about, she's like--

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.635
(clapping)

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:30.695
She knows what I'm talking about.

00:00:30.695 --> 00:00:31.710
(laughing)

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:32.543
On my dog,

00:00:32.543 --> 00:00:33.810
I will spend anything.
- Not your birthday,

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:34.830
not yours?

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:37.180
- Listen, my birthday
I'll be up in a Denny's,

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.150
just being casual okay,
but my dogs birthday--

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:41.430
- [Kelly] Moons Over My Hammy.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.110
- So he recently turned two,
I know, they grow up so fast.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.410
- Mine just turned two.
- Oh really?

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:46.510
- Henry, yeah.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:47.343
- When we're the same.

00:00:47.343 --> 00:00:48.490
- Yeah, we're the same human.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:50.240
- My dog turned two and I gave him a

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.804
Harry Potter themed birthday.

00:00:51.804 --> 00:00:53.410
(laughing)
Yes.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:54.965
- [Kelly] I love Harry Potter.

00:00:54.965 --> 00:00:56.132
- [Lilly] Yes!

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:59.113
Have you seen this wizard?

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.419
- It took place in "Dogwarts",
thank you, thank you!

00:01:03.419 --> 00:01:05.960
(laughing)
Thank you!

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.640
- [Kelly] I love Harry Potter as well.

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:08.600
- [Lilly] I mean, it was great.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:12.880
All of his dog friends came,
I made all these cupcakes,

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.850
look at him, he's dressed as a Gryffindor,

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:15.746
I mean it's just a

00:01:15.746 --> 00:01:16.671
whole thing.
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh,

00:01:16.671 --> 00:01:17.662
I love you.

00:01:17.662 --> 00:01:18.495
- Thank you.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:20.580
- That's so cute that you
spend your money on others,

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.148
- Oh absolutely.
- I do the same, totally.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:22.981
(laughing)

00:01:22.981 --> 00:01:26.020
- I feel like I have
my priorities in check.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:26.940
- Me too.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:27.879
Mine are different though.

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:30.100
(laughing)

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.950
I was like, Happy Birthday Henry.

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:32.783
Snuggle.

00:01:32.783 --> 00:01:34.148
(laughing)

